  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Societal Integration, Resilience and Well-Being of Marginal Target Groups</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under this project UNDP will support the ministry in enhancing societal integration, resilience and well-being of marginal target groups, assured access to public schemes and sustainable economic empowerment opportunities through: 1.      Improved access to government programmes and targeted service delivery for vulnerable and marginal communities2.      Enhanced socio-economic opportunities and well-being for the identified target groups.3.      Enhanced effectiveness, leading to evidence-based decision-making, potential improvements, and refinement in strategies for identified target groups.</narrative>
  </description>
